    "image_with_text_QfY9LW": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Akr8Xy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Adhesive Tapes and BOPP Labels by NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_CBqEe4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you can imagine it, we will make it stick. At NADCO, we can make any kind of label our customers need, including high-quality, custom-printed adhesive tapes and BOPP stickers for the chemical industry. Our BOPP labels are the perfect solution for safety, product identification, sealing, protection, and other purposes. In addition to producing custom tapes and labels, we also provide prototyping, graphic design, die cutting, and digital printing services to offer a full-service experience for our customers.</p><p>When you work with NADCO, you will enjoy our:</p><ul><li><strong>Comprehensive Custom Capabilities:</strong> We create all designs in-house, working closely with customers to develop specialized solutions to meet their needs.</li><li><strong>Consistent Quality and Customer Service:</strong> Our products are custom-designed in-house, so we guarantee clear communication between vendors every time. This allows us to maintain a consistent level of quality and service each time you work with NADCO.</li><li><strong>Fast Turnarounds:</strong> NADCO’s full-service manufacturing line ensures that no time is lost waiting for parts from other facilities. This creates efficient production processes and improves our accountability.</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\" title=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\">Contact us</a> for more information, or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> to start your order.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
